### 16. Health and Wellness Programs

OMI values the health and well-being of its employees. A robust health and wellness program will be implemented to promote physical and mental wellness within the workforce.

**Wellness Initiatives:**

- **Health Screenings and Assessments:** OMI will provide annual health screenings for employees to encourage proactive health management.

  **Procedure:**
  - Employees will have access to free health screenings, including blood pressure checks, cholesterol levels, and body mass index assessments, conducted by a certified healthcare provider.
